Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `tensor` was made with `:`, so it can't be changed
  --> tests/ui/compute_set_immutable.jet:5:17
    |
  5 |     compute.set(tensor, [0, 1], 3.0) ?? panic("set")
    |                 ^^^^^^
 Why: `set: fn(tensor: &Tensor, index: [Int], value: Float)` changes this input, so `tensor` must be mutable (`:=`)
 Fix: Declare it with `tensor := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111
